              },
              "text": "func (valSet *defaultSet) QuorumSize() int {\n\t//c.currentLogger(true, nil).Trace(\"WBFT: confirmation Formula used ceil(2N/3)\")\n\treturn int(math.Ceil(float64(valSet.Size()) - valSet.F()))\n}\n"
